# Code owners — R3 of docs/architecture/core-plugin-refactor.md.
#
# Everything listed here is CORE. A PR that touches it cannot merge without an
# explicit review from an owner (requires "Require review from Code Owners" in
# branch protection for `main` — the file alone only requests the review).
#
# Two groups are listed, because the refactor has not happened yet:
#
#   1. The TARGET layout (`core/`, plus the packages that are core by nature).
#      Empty or already-owned today; listed so the protection is in place before
#      the first package lands.
#
#   2. TODAY'S core inside `src/` (§6.1 of the RFC). This is the group that makes
#      phase 0 worth landing on its own — without it, "core is protected" would
#      only become true at the end of a quarter-long migration.
#
# `tools/architecture/boundaries.test.ts` asserts that every core path in
# `tools/architecture/boundaries.mjs` is covered by a rule below, so the two
# cannot drift apart.

# ── Target layout ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/core/                          @ewyct
/plugins/*/package.json         @ewyct

# ── Core packages ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/packages/db/                   @ewyct
/packages/eb-protocol/          @ewyct
/packages/pool-service/         @ewyct
/packages/embedded-browser/     @ewyct
/packages/shared/               @ewyct

# ── Today's core inside src/ (RFC §6.1) ──────────────────────────────────────
/src/lib/db/                    @ewyct
/src/lib/eb/                    @ewyct
/src/lib/execution/             @ewyct
/src/lib/diff/                  @ewyct
/src/lib/ai/                    @ewyct
/src/lib/auth/                  @ewyct
/src/lib/billing/               @ewyct
/src/lib/security/              @ewyct
/src/lib/rate-limit/            @ewyct
/src/lib/verify/                @ewyct
/src/lib/comparison/            @ewyct
/src/lib/ws/                    @ewyct
/src/lib/storage/               @ewyct
/src/lib/ocr/                   @ewyct
/src/lib/http/                  @ewyct
/src/lib/settings/              @ewyct
/src/lib/constants/             @ewyct
/src/lib/vars/                  @ewyct
/src/lib/hooks/                 @ewyct
